{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "1d100d061a491f921b4fe68a0207b466227af877c35b926fb61d3e6ec69c1623", "ja": "波乱の芽", "zh": "波澜的萌芽", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "84b705cf7fae45be0daa6a1a521ecbaac31be0d4bb5ecb007c18f267e5d75176", "ja": "千早の妹になりたい環は、千早に妹以外の\nクッキーをもらわないよう助言した茜を呼び\n止める。「どうしてジャマをするのか」と\n尋ねる環に、茜は「ジャマをしてるのは\nそっちじゃないの」と答える。", "zh": "想成为千早妹妹的环叫住了劝她不要以妹妹以外的身份从千早那里拿饼干的茜。“为什么要妨碍我？”面对环的询问，茜回答道：“在妨碍人的不是你吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1000_se", "source_sha256": "f98f4cdb4e7b7d62a2dbbd0a5a370f5f947a3f027cc94e2530dd88cc113b1ccd", "ja": "キーンコーン\nカーンコーン", "zh": "叮——咚——\n铛——咚——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "c0d055b3f3bcc11ad1e5b28c6b68c035e15e9ef9169865ba3b1a18328c4a71a0", "ja": "あの。\n……ちょっと、いいですか", "zh": "那个。\n……请问，能打扰一下吗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "ccfa65c39e11cf682b0df8c0be3587e473d96ae616792105cdbef537580d600e", "ja": "大神環。\n聖歌隊の1年生です。", "zh": "大神环。\n是圣歌队的1年级生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "dfabf21017c742b3b28ad7fba08daede1735a8c09de7b8098630824ce4ce00c4", "ja": "そう、環ちゃんとおっしゃるのね。\n私に、何か用事かしら？", "zh": "原来是叫环呀。\n找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "9c65b5f661b56b663edc654f170c972ae9efe36824161db0f827b3f423611798", "ja": "先輩、どうしてボクのジャマをするんですか？", "zh": "前辈，为什么要妨碍我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "47c401241cb2624a957131ad3b9873a49ec863e1d374e45a3696718cf2bfb2df", "ja": "この前、千早さんに言ったでしょ。\n妹以外のクッキーをもらっちゃダメだって。", "zh": "之前不是跟千早说过吗？不可以收妹妹以外的人送的曲奇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "5645d486f21dbd3e8680d6b4adebc1a2b24b6c374736bc52f807335ee1cb27b0", "ja": "んん？　そんなこと言ったかな～？", "zh": "嗯？我说了那样的话吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "9de119d7b5f4a9828f841393ce1f73d0197f94845fdf23baa0ac2ee7fe7c6124", "ja": "ごまかさないで。……あなたには関係ないのに、\nどうしてジャマするの？", "zh": "别想蒙混过去。……明明和你没关系，\n为什么要来妨碍我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "9edc1a106b1a23faaf9cd2d9c9fb84e395124c97a24eec82e6b860754e717148", "ja": "まあたしかに、直接\n関係はありませんけど……。", "zh": "确实，虽然跟我没有\n直接关系就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "26b43c449f630a176c10a119de00943dae18bbdca01ad48d3d933a6e35921c7a", "ja": "ジャマをしてるのは、そっちのほうなんじゃ\nないのかニャ～？　……なんて♪", "zh": "妨碍别人的，难道不是你们那边吗～？……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "f90a8949da6d98ee645424ab87450a4bb88858d6e10e1f74d050af3d6e5664dd", "ja": "千早さん達は、姉妹になったばかりなんでしょ？\nちょっと乱暴じゃなくって？　そういうの。", "zh": "千早她们不是才刚成为姐妹吗？\n是不是有点太粗暴了？这种做法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "c3203d1a9540bc0140467289e3168a89dbc3da35f37de8758161fb696ba702e4", "ja": "……姉妹になったばっかりなんだから、\nまだチャンスはあるでしょ。", "zh": "……既然才刚成为姐妹，\n就表示还有机会对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8f55fb2209b6fec8bb7716d8abc9161a6ba1b7a22e69d747a2e320384dc0ad1", "ja": "あー、そう来ちゃったか……\nていうか、やっぱ自覚はあるんだね？", "zh": "啊～，竟然是这种展开吗……\n话说回来，果然你还是有自知的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "8fe0e6e88dbfbc4e51eb9f84e08713ccfd9c0e92adb374cd176b83fd36d8b245", "ja": "聞いてもいい？　環ちゃんは、\n千早さんのどこがそんなに好きなの？", "zh": "可以问问吗？环最喜欢千早小姐的哪一点，喜欢到这种程度？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "69f01397f075d5e82a67bb1431622257dd79a78c5736502c2a1d97684a01eb11", "ja": "どこって……一番は歌だけど。\n千早さん、優しいし……。", "zh": "要说最喜欢哪里……第一肯定是歌声了。\n千早姐也很温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "244878adc0d228fb9e5cf73ecc52744e2db918855d861f1123c6748ffa3cc2a8", "ja": "言っておくけど、ボク、悪者になりたいわけじゃ\nないから。千早さんが迷ってるなら、ってだけ。", "zh": "先说好，我可不是想当坏人。只是觉得，要是千早姐姐在犹豫的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "b66c44424605ca228ae6e0127f740dad9b508494373388055dbc67630fa00d6c", "ja": "それはそうだよね。\n誰だって、悪者になんかなりたくないと思うよ？", "zh": "确实是这样呢。\n我想，任谁都不愿意当什么坏人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "ffd48876f466316d0481814108945b779d6a1d10dfabd3a7a0abb39631e21839", "ja": "環ちゃん、思ったよりいい子だね。\nなんだかうれしいですわ。", "zh": "小环，没想到你比想象中还要乖呢。总觉得好开心呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "92282cbd6266e3f252d92a24a2388a79fc5806f14d32cfcaf9a3f8f67e9ebed0", "ja": "先輩にほめられても、うれしくない。", "zh": "就算被前辈夸奖，也高兴不起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "1a05ed3a966ed63cf70a8d5bc9d3afd2e28ec5235474a3a181e07e0120248e3a", "ja": "あ、いたいた。環さん！\nそろそろ移動しないと、授業が始まっちゃうよ。", "zh": "啊，找到了。环小姐！\n差不多该走了，不然就要开始上课了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "6230a90bcebea561f3085d016a1f776bb580939627de8b9881148b4d328e306b", "ja": "お迎えが来ちゃったみたいだね。\nそれじゃ、私は失礼するわ。", "zh": "看来接你的人已经来了呢。\n那我就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_02_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "b499fec830263bf9cc5c90cd4b60bbb4c84e67892a795997c8714ca80849d99d", "ja": "お話があるなら、いつでも2年生の教室にどうぞ！\n歓迎しましてよ、環ちゃん♪", "zh": "如果有话要说，随时欢迎来2年级的教室！\n我会热烈欢迎你的哦，环♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
